      "cooked": "<p>Question:</p><p>If I choose to use the Power on Staff of Ra (Projectile Damage) to destroy a Treacherous Ape, can the Staff of Ra be selected as the equipment which is destroyed by the Treacherous Ape as a result of destroying it?&nbsp; Or would the staff of Ra already be destroyed because of the effect on the Staff of Ra power?&nbsp; What is your ruling and please explain reasoning.&nbsp; This gets a little nit-picky but I'm quite curious to see which gets resolved first.&nbsp; Treacherous Ape is from the Dreamer's deck.&nbsp; Thanks in advance.</p>",
